            <div class="body">
              
  <p>[ <a class="reference internal" href="../index.html#cli-aws"><span class="std std-ref">aws</span></a> . <a class="reference internal" href="index.html#cli-aws-ec2"><span class="std std-ref">ec2</span></a> ]</p>
<div class="section" id="modify-vpc-endpoint">
<span id="cli-aws-ec2-modify-vpc-endpoint"></span><h1>modify-vpc-endpoint<a class="headerlink" href="#modify-vpc-endpoint" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<div class="section" id="description">
<h2>Description<a class="headerlink" href="#description" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<p>Modifies attributes of a specified VPC endpoint. The attributes that you can modify depend on the type of VPC endpoint (interface, gateway, or Gateway Load Balancer). For more information, see the <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/privatelink/">Amazon Web Services PrivateLink Guide</a> .</p>
<p>See also: <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/goto/WebAPI/ec2-2016-11-15/ModifyVpcEndpoint">AWS API Documentation</a></p>
</div>
<div class="section" id="synopsis">
<h2>Synopsis<a class="headerlink" href="#synopsis" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<div class="highlight-default notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span>  <span class="n">modify</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">vpc</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">endpoint</span>
<span class="p">[</span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">dry</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">run</span> <span class="o">|</span> <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">no</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">dry</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">run</span><span class="p">]</span>
<span class="o">--</span><span class="n">vpc</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">endpoint</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nb">id</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">value</span><span class="o">&gt;</span>
<span class="p">[</span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">reset</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">policy</span> <span class="o">|</span> <span class="o">--</span><span class="n">no</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">reset</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">policy</span><span class="p">]</span>
